end
= Route116_EventScript_WandasBoyfriend
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_RECOVERED_DEVON_GOODS Route116_EventScript_BoyfriendGruntLeftTunnel
goto_if_set FLAG_DEVON_GOODS_STOLEN Route116_EventScript_BoyfriendGruntInTunnel
msgbox	Nnn… Roar!I want to dig that tunnel!
release
end
= Route116_EventScript_BoyfriendGruntInTunnel
msgbox	Nnn… Roar! What's going on?I was digging the tunnel without any tools when some goon ordered me out!That tunnel's filled with POKéMON that react badly to loud noises. They could cause an uproar.That's why we stopped using heavy equipment for tunneling…I'm worried that the goon will do something stupid and startle the POKéMON into an uproar.
release
end
= Route116_EventScript_BoyfriendGruntLeftTunnel
msgbox	Nnn… Roar!That goofy goon hightailed it out of the tunnel! I can go back to digging!
release
end
